# pi + rpiv local state (never part of the extension)
.pi/
# .rpiv is local state, EXCEPT the two phase-1 deliverables of the
# 2026-10-05 retrieve-recompression plan (the falsification harness),
# which must be visible to git. Cannot negate below a fully-ignored
# dir, hence the /* restructure. Everything else stays local.
.rpiv/*
!.rpiv/tmp/
.rpiv/tmp/*
!.rpiv/tmp/hdrv/
.rpiv/tmp/hdrv/*
!.rpiv/tmp/hdrv/test_retrieve_forms.py
!.rpiv/tmp/hdrv/driver_e2e.mjs
